<title>USA: ST JOSEPH HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>ST JOSEPH HOGS $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST. JOSEPH 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Top $54.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3	230-270 lbs    54.00-54.50</p>
<p>US 1-2	Pkg 211 lbs    51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  Not enough to test the market.</p>
